355 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (BioToken is a decentralized, end-to-end verification framework that gives every batch of high-value reagent a tamper-proof digital identity. It fuses three technologies into a single pipeline: an ERC-721 NFT for on-chain identity, a Groth16 zero-knowledge proof that commits to a reagent's chemical fingerprint without ever exposing the manufacturer's proprietary data, and an XGBoost anomaly detector that screens every batch before verification is even attempted. The result is cryptographic proof of authenticity with no trusted third party, no IoT hardware, and zero extra steps for couriers.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
